<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's Styl to sell 10,000 own shares.</title>
<headline>Hungary's Styl to sell 10,000 own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian garment factory Styl Ruhagyar Rt announced on Wednesday it gave a commission to a brokerage to sell 10,000 of its own shares at market prices. The company did not give more details.</p>
<p>On Tuesday Styl shares finished at 1,775 forints, up 25.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
